{'symbol': 'GNRC', 'date': '2023-01-06 22:50:00', 'title': 'GENERAC HOLDINGS SHAREHOLDER ALERT BY FORMER LOUISIANA ATTORNEY GENERAL: KAHN SWICK & FOTI, LLC REMINDS INVESTORS WITH LOSSES IN EXCESS OF $100,000 OF LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE IN CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. - GNRC', 'text': 'NEW ORLEANS , JAN. 6, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KAHN SWICK & FOTI, LLC ("KSF") AND KSF PARTNER, FORMER ATTORNEY GENERAL OF LOUISIANA, CHARLES C. FOTI, JR., REMIND INVESTORS THAT THEY HAVE UNTIL JANUARY 30, 2023 TO FILE LEAD PLAINTIFF APPLICATIONS IN A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. (NYSE: GNRC), IF THEY PURCHASED THE COMPANY\'S SHARES BETWEEN APRIL 29, 2021 AND NOVEMBER 1, 2022, INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD").'}{'symbol': 'GNRC', 'date': '2023-01-06 14:46:00', 'title': 'GNRC LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - JANUARY 6, 2023) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. ("GENERAC" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: GNRC) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF GENERAC INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE EASTERN DISTRICT OF WISCONSIN. THIS LAWSUIT IS ON BEHALF OF ALL INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED GENERAC HOLDINGS INC.'}{'symbol': 'GNRC', 'date': '2023-01-06 13:00:00', 'title': 'GNRC INVESTORS HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. SECURITIES FRAUD LAWSUIT', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES , JAN. 6, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- GLANCY PRONGAY & MURRAY LLP ("GPM") ANNOUNCES THAT INVESTORS WITH SUBSTANTIAL LOSSES HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD THE SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. ("GENERAC" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: GNRC). CLASS PERIOD: APRIL 29, 2021 – NOVEMBER 1, 2022 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE: JANUARY 30, 2023 IF YOU WISH TO SERVE AS LEAD PLAINTIFF OF THE GENERAC LAWSUIT, YOU CAN SUBMIT YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION AT WWW.GLANCYLAW.COM/CASES/GENERAC-HOLDINGS-INC/.'}{'symbol': 'GNRC', 'date': '2023-01-06 11:46:00', 'title': "GNRC DEADLINE: HAGENS BERMAN, NATIONAL TRIAL ATTORNEYS, ENCOURAGES GENERAC HOLDINGS (GNRC) INVESTORS WITH SIGNIFICANT LOSSES TO CONTACT FIRM'S ATTORNEYS, SECURITIES CLASS ACTION PENDING", 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO, CALIFORNIA--(NEWSFILE CORP. - JANUARY 6, 2023) - HAGENS BERMAN URGES GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. (NYSE: GNRC) INVESTORS WHO SUFFERED SIGNIFICANT LOSSES TO SUBMIT YOUR LOSSES NOW.CLASS PERIOD: APR. 29, 2021 - NOV. 1, 2022LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE: JAN. 30, 2023VISIT: WWW.HBSSLAW.COM/INVESTOR-FRAUD/GNRCCONTACT AN ATTORNEY NOW: GNRC@HBSSLAW.COM844-916-0895GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. (NYSE: GNRC) SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION:THE LITIGATION CHALLENGES GENERAC'S STATEMENTS CONCERNING THE SAFETY AND SUCCESS OF ITS PWRCELL SOLAR ENERGY OFF"}{'symbol': 'GNRC', 'date': '2023-01-06 05:45:00', 'title': 'GNRC SHAREHOLDER ALERT: JAKUBOWITZ LAW REMINDS GENERAC SHAREHOLDERS OF A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF JANUARY 30, 2023', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JAN. 6, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JAKUBOWITZ LAW ANNOUNCES THAT A SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS COMMENCED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. (NYSE: GNRC). TO RECEIVE UPDATES ON THE LAWSUIT, FILL OUT THE FORM: HTTPS://CLAIMYOURLOSS.COM/SECURITIES/GENERAC-HOLDINGS-LOSS-SUBMISSION-FORM/?ID=35353&FROM=4 THIS LAWSUIT IS ON BEHALF OF ALL INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED GENERAC HOLDINGS INC. COMMON STOCK BETWEEN APRIL 29, 2021, AND NOVEMBER 1, 2022, INCLUSIVE.'}